{"title":"Cloud Engineer Roadmap","role":"Cloud Engineer","summary":"Build from Linux, networking and programming into cloud architecture, infrastructure as code, containers, security, observability and reliable production systems.","facts":{"Starts":"2026","Current degree":"B.Tech / B.E. — Computer Science & Engineering (CSE)","Timeline assumption":"Four-year B.Tech/B.E. programme beginning in 2026 and ending around 2030."},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[{"period":"2026–2030","question":"What can I enter now?","output":"Build Linux, networking, cloud, containers, scripting and infrastructure-as-code skills with deployable projects."},{"period":"2030–2035","question":"How should I specialise?","output":"Develop depth in cloud architecture, platform engineering, Kubernetes, security or SRE."},{"period":"2035–2040","question":"How should I evolve?","output":"Own cloud platforms, reliability, security, cost controls and architecture decisions."},{"period":"2040–2046","question":"How can I remain relevant?","output":"Combine cloud engineering with distributed systems, cloud security, AI-enabled operations and technical leadership."}],"sections":[{"heading":"What to build each year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["When","Build this","Learn from (free unless noted, with official URLs)","Proof of progress","Gap it moves"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1 · Sem 1"},{"text":"Linux, Git, shell and programming"},{"text":"Linux Foundation training; Git documentation","url":"https://training.linuxfoundation.org/"},{"text":"Linux VM + 5 shell automation scripts + ≥20 meaningful commits"},{"text":"Systems fundamentals"}],[{"text":"Year 1 · Sem 2"},{"text":"Networking, HTTP, DNS and Python"},{"text":"MDN HTTP overview; Python documentation","url":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTTP/Overview"},{"text":"Network troubleshooting lab with documented DNS, HTTP and TCP observations"},{"text":"Networking"}],[{"text":"Year 2 · Sem 3"},{"text":"Cloud fundamentals and IAM"},{"text":"AWS Skill Builder; Microsoft Learn","url":"https://skillbuilder.aws/"},{"text":"Deploy a small service and document IAM permissions and network architecture"},{"text":"Cloud fundamentals"}],[{"text":"Year 2 · Sem 4"},{"text":"Docker, storage and databases"},{"text":"Docker documentation; PostgreSQL documentation","url":"https://docs.docker.com/"},{"text":"Containerised application with persistent storage and documented backup approach"},{"text":"Cloud application infrastructure"}],[{"text":"Year 3 · Sem 5"},{"text":"Infrastructure as Code + CI/CD"},{"text":"Terraform documentation; GitHub Actions","url":"https://developer.hashicorp.com/terraform/docs"},{"text":"Recreate environment from code and deploy automatically through CI/CD"},{"text":"Infrastructure automation"}],[{"text":"Year 3 · Sem 6"},{"text":"Kubernetes + observability"},{"text":"Kubernetes documentation; OpenTelemetry","url":"https://kubernetes.io/docs/"},{"text":"Kubernetes deployment with logs, metrics, traces and health checks"},{"text":"Production operations"}],[{"text":"Year 4 · Sem 7"},{"text":"Security, reliability and architecture"},{"text":"OWASP; Google SRE resources","url":"https://owasp.org/"},{"text":"Production-style cloud architecture document with security and reliability controls"},{"text":"Senior foundations"}],[{"text":"Year 4 · Sem 8"},{"text":"Internship + placement preparation"},{"text":"LeetCode; employer-specific official documentation","url":"https://leetcode.com/"},{"text":"Cloud portfolio + resume + troubleshooting/system-design practice"},{"text":"First-job readiness"}]]},{"type":"note","label":"4-year honours variant","text":"Use the additional academic depth for distributed systems, advanced networking, cloud security, research, an extended cloud project or an industry internship."},{"type":"h","text":"Specialisation"},{"type":"table","header":["Lane","Core stack","Learn from","Senior role it leads to"],"rows":[[{"text":"AWS Cloud"},{"text":"AWS, Linux, Terraform, Docker, Kubernetes"},{"text":"AWS Skill Builder","url":"https://skillbuilder.aws/"},{"text":"Senior Cloud Engineer"}],[{"text":"Azure Cloud"},{"text":"Azure, Linux, Terraform, containers, networking"},{"text":"Microsoft Learn","url":"https://learn.microsoft.com/training/"},{"text":"Senior Azure Cloud Engineer"}],[{"text":"Platform Engineering"},{"text":"Kubernetes, Helm, CI/CD, developer platforms"},{"text":"Kubernetes","url":"https://kubernetes.io/docs/"},{"text":"Platform Engineer / Staff Engineer"}],[{"text":"SRE"},{"text":"SLOs, observability, incident response, automation"},{"text":"Google SRE; OpenTelemetry","url":"https://sre.google/"},{"text":"Senior SRE"}],[{"text":"Cloud Security"},{"text":"IAM, networking, secrets, vulnerability management"},{"text":"OWASP","url":"https://owasp.org/"},{"text":"Cloud Security Engineer"}]]},{"type":"note","label":"Evolve and stay relevant, 2035–2046","text":"Learn cloud concepts rather than tying your entire career to one provider's console. Keep networking, Linux, distributed systems, security, automation and observability strong so that your skills transfer across cloud environments."}]},{"heading":"Internships","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Government"},{"type":"table","header":["Route","Who can apply","Pay and cost","Link"],"rows":[[{"text":"AICTE Internship Portal"},{"text":"Students meeting individual internship requirements"},{"text":"Check the official site"},{"text":"AICTE Internship Portal","url":"https://internship.aicte-india.org/"}],[{"text":"ISRO student opportunities"},{"text":"Eligibility varies by centre/programme"},{"text":"Check the official site"},{"text":"ISRO","url":"https://www.isro.gov.in/"}],[{"text":"DRDO internships"},{"text":"Eligibility varies by laboratory/programme"},{"text":"Check the official site"},{"text":"DRDO","url":"https://www.drdo.gov.in/"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Private and open-source"},{"type":"table","header":["Route","What it is","Cost and timing","Link"],"rows":[[{"text":"Google Summer of Code"},{"text":"Open-source development programme"},{"text":"Check the current payment/timing"},{"text":"Google Summer of Code","url":"https://summerofcode.withgoogle.com/"}],[{"text":"GitHub open source"},{"text":"Infrastructure/software contributions"},{"text":"Free; opportunities vary"},{"text":"GitHub","url":"https://github.com/"}],[{"text":"Smart India Hackathon"},{"text":"College-based innovation competition"},{"text":"Check the current edition"},{"text":"Smart India Hackathon","url":"https://www.sih.gov.in/"}]]},{"type":"note","label":"Eligibility note","text":"GSoC has a minimum age of 18 and does not require a degree. Smart India Hackathon uses college registration and edition-specific team rules; verify the current edition."}]},{"heading":"Certifications in demand","kind":"certifications","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Certification","Cost","When to take it","Why it helps","Link"],"rows":[[{"text":"NPTEL/SWAYAM Linux/cloud course"},{"text":"Free to learn; exam fee: check the official site"},{"text":"Years 1–3"},{"text":"Structured systems and cloud knowledge"},{"text":"NPTEL","url":"https://nptel.ac.in/"}],[{"text":"freeCodeCamp certifications"},{"text":"Free"},{"text":"Years 1–3"},{"text":"Programming fundamentals"},{"text":"freeCodeCamp","url":"https://www.freecodecamp.org/"}],[{"text":"AWS Certified Cloud Practitioner"},{"text":"Paid — check the official site"},{"text":"Year 2"},{"text":"Cloud vocabulary and fundamentals"},{"text":"AWS Certification","url":"https://aws.amazon.com/certification/"}],[{"text":"Microsoft Azure Fundamentals AZ-900"},{"text":"Paid — check the official site"},{"text":"Year 2"},{"text":"Azure fundamentals"},{"text":"Microsoft Credentials","url":"https://learn.microsoft.com/credentials/"}],[{"text":"Kubernetes certification"},{"text":"Paid — check the official site"},{"text":"Years 3–4"},{"text":"Kubernetes competence"},{"text":"CNCF Certification","url":"https://www.cncf.io/training/certification/"}]]},{"type":"note","label":"Fee note","text":"Confirm current pricing directly with the provider before paying."}]},{"heading":"Careers you can be hired as","kind":"careers","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"First-job titles"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Cloud Engineer"},{"text":"Junior Cloud Engineer"},{"text":"Cloud Operations Engineer"},{"text":"DevOps Engineer"},{"text":"Infrastructure Engineer"},{"text":"Platform Engineer"},{"text":"Site Reliability Engineer"},{"text":"Associate Cloud Engineer"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Adjacent roles"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"DevSecOps Engineer"},{"text":"Cloud Security Engineer"},{"text":"Systems Engineer"},{"text":"Network Engineer"},{"text":"Backend Developer"},{"text":"Database Engineer"},{"text":"Release Engineer"}]},{"type":"table","header":["Role","Stack the posting asks for","Where the student proves it"],"rows":[[{"text":"Cloud Engineer"},{"text":"Cloud platform, Linux, networking, IAM, Terraform"},{"text":"IaC cloud project"}],[{"text":"DevOps Engineer"},{"text":"Linux, Docker, CI/CD, cloud, scripting"},{"text":"Automated deployment pipeline"}],[{"text":"Platform Engineer"},{"text":"Kubernetes, containers, IaC, developer tooling"},{"text":"Kubernetes platform project"}],[{"text":"SRE"},{"text":"Monitoring, automation, SLOs, incident response"},{"text":"Observable service + incident runbook"}],[{"text":"Cloud Security Engineer"},{"text":"IAM, networking, secrets, security controls"},{"text":"Security-focused cloud architecture"}],[{"text":"Infrastructure Engineer"},{"text":"Linux, networking, Terraform, automation"},{"text":"Reproducible infrastructure repository"}]]},{"type":"note","label":"Job-posting note","text":"Cloud job requirements vary across AWS, Azure and GCP environments. Check current employer postings before selecting your primary provider."}]},{"heading":"Postgraduate study in India","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Route","Entrance exam and timing","Who