e, English and funding"}],[{"text":"Germany"},{"text":"TUM, RWTH Aachen"},{"text":"DAAD / university funding"},{"text":"Degree match, grades and language"}],[{"text":"Canada"},{"text":"Toronto, UBC, Waterloo"},{"text":"University funding"},{"text":"Degree equivalence, English and funding"}],[{"text":"Australia"},{"text":"Melbourne, UNSW, ANU"},{"text":"University scholarships"},{"text":"Academic and English requirements"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Application pack"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Academic transcripts"},{"text":"Degree/provisional certificate"},{"text":"CV"},{"text":"Statement of purpose"},{"text":"Academic/professional references"},{"text":"English-language test where required"},{"text":"GitHub/infrastructure portfolio"},{"text":"Research proposal where required"},{"text":"Scholarship documents"},{"text":"Passport and financial documents"}]},{"type":"note","label":"Visa and job-offer note","text":"Admission, scholarships, student visas and post-study work rights are separate matters. Verify the destination's current immigration rules for the intended intake."}]},{"heading":"Going forward","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"flow","items":["Student Developer","Junior Cloud Engineer","Cloud Engineer","Senior Cloud Engineer / SRE","Staff/Principal Engineer or Engineering Manager","Cloud/Platform leadership"],"label":"Career progression"},{"type":"p","text":"Typical years vary by employer and individual progression."},{"type":"h","text":"PhD routes"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Distributed Systems"},{"text":"Cloud Computing"},{"text":"Computer Networks"},{"text":"Operating Systems"},{"text":"Cybersecurity"},{"text":"Software Engineering"},{"text":"High-Performance Computing"},{"text":"Database Systems"},{"text":"Systems Engineering"},{"text":"AI Infrastructure"}]},{"type":"note","label":"2040–2046","text":"Senior cloud engineering increasingly involves architecture, reliability, security, observability and cost management. Maintain deep knowledge of 